---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="easyhaloo · 技术笔记与工程译文" description="easyhaloo 的技术笔记、历史博客归档与 Anthropic Engineering 中文译文。">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">EST. 2018 · REBUILT WITH ASTRO</p>
    <h1>把技术沉淀为<br /><em>可回访的知识。</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">这里保留既有的技术博客归档，并新增对工程实践文章的中文阅读入口。站点优先保证内容可读、链接可追溯与长期可维护。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/engineering-cn/">浏览工程译文</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/legacy/">查看旧站归档</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid" aria-label="站点内容入口">
    <a class="feature feature-wide" href="/engineering-cn/">
      <span class="kicker">持续更新</span>
      <h2>Anthropic Engineering<br />中文译文</h2>
      <p>在保留图文布局、代码、表格与原文链接的前提下，形成可直接阅读的中文镜像专题。</p>
      <span class="arrow">进入专题 →</span>
    </a>
    <a class="feature" href="/legacy/">
      <span class="kicker">历史存档</span>
      <h2>技术博客<br />2018—</h2>
      <p>Java、JavaScript、Spring Cloud、MyBatis、Linux 与工程实践的原始文章归档。</p>
      <span class="arrow">打开归档 →</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="principles">
    <p class="eyebrow">PUBLISHING PRINCIPLES</p>
    <div>
      <h2>清晰、可追溯、可长期维护。</h2>
      <p>每篇外部来源译文均应明确标记为非官方中文译文、保留原始链接，并在确认具有适当授权后公开。站点采用静态构建与 GitHub Pages 部署，发布记录由 Git 提交保存。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .hero { padding: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 8rem) 0 5rem; max-width: 840px; }
    .eyebrow, .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: .73rem; letter-spacing: .13em; font-weight: 760; color: var(--accent); }
    h1 { margin: .85rem 0 1.35rem; font-size: clamp(3.1rem, 7.6vw, 6.75rem); line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.075em; font-weight: 780; }
    h1 em { font-family: ui-serif, Georgia, serif; font-weight: 450; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
    .lede { max-width: 650px; margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.12rem; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    .button { display: inline-block; padding: .72rem 1rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid var(--line); font-weight: 680; }
    .button.primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); border-color: var(--accent); }
    .button.secondary { color: var(--ink); }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
    .feature { min-height: 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 1.8rem; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); transition: transform .2s ease, border-color .2s ease; }
    .feature:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--ink); }
    .feature-wide { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--surface), var(--surface-alt)); }
    .feature h2 { margin: .7rem 0 .75rem; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.7rem); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .feature p { max-width: 35rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
    .arrow { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 1.8rem; font-weight: 720; color: var(--accent); }
    .principles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: 1rem; padding: 6rem 0 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .principles h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.6rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0; }
    .principles p:last-child { margin: 1rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .grid, .principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .feature { min-height: 235px; } .principles { padding-top: 4rem; } }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
